# ThreadSanitizer suppressions (preset tsan, .github/workflows/tsan.yml). Only Gothar's own code is instrumented; the
# vcpkg libraries are not, so TSan cannot see their synchronisation and may report races inside them. Suppress those
# by library only - never a race in engine/, game/ or tools/ code.
race:JPH::
race:SDL_
deadlock:JPH::
